      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "Suppose that $X$ and $Y$ are sets. If $|X|=0$ and $|Y|=7,$ then $|P(X)|+|P(Y)|=$",
      "worked_solution": "For any set $S$, $|P(S)|={2}^{|S|}.$ \n\nIn this case, $|X|=0$ and $|Y|=7,$ so we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|P(X)|+|P(Y)| & ={2}^{|X|}+{2}^{|Y|} \\\\  & ={2}^{0}+{2}^{7} \\\\  & =1+128 \\\\  & =129.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
